{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/extras/Header1.gif?t=1749495610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/extras/GamePlayGIF.gif?t=1749495610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A horde survivor soaked in ink and tragedy \u2013 fight your way through the sketchbook page by page and uncover the grim past of a broken fate. Face creatures that began as innocent doodles and ended as mirrors of a devoured soul. Collect inspiration, learn, and piece together fragments of memory to forge absurd synergies. Are you ready to face the truth on the final page?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/extras/header3.gif?t=1749495610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/extras/ObserverGIF.gif?t=1749495610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is this? Corrupted AI?\u00a0A psychologist? A friend? A literal ghost? One thing\u2019s certain: it sees everything and it analyzes. Step into a psychological cat-and-mouse game with a mysterious entity that always seems one step ahead of you. Do you play aggressive? Defensive? Keep rerolling? The Observer knows. What it does with that knowledge\u2026 is up to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/extras/Header2.gif?t=1749495610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/extras/DiveDeeperGIF.gif?t=1749495610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think twice before diving deeper into J.\u2019s shattered life \u2013 timing is everything. Drag buried memories to the surface, but only if you're ready to deal with what you\u2019ll find down there</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776600?t=1749495610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/48a3ee77153e8c37279052d52aaa8c5e53b32b65/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749495610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/275c17df4e7238aa5983f5ca60a7129886ed52bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749495610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/275c17df4e7238aa5983f5ca60a7129886ed52bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749495610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/extras/Header1.gif?t=1749495610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/extras/GamePlayGIF.gif?t=1749495610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A horde survivor soaked in ink and tragedy \u2013 fight your way through the sketchbook page by page and uncover the grim past of a broken fate. Face creatures that began as innocent doodles and ended as mirrors of a devoured soul. Collect inspiration, learn, and piece together fragments of memory to forge absurd synergies. Are you ready to face the truth on the final page?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776600/extras/header3.gif?t=1749495610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_im